SUMMARY:✨ She Owns It AVL ✨
DESCRIPTION:✨She Owns It AVL✨\n✨ **She Owns It Meetup** ✨\n\n**May
  Featured Guest: Tera Pruett\,** founder of Unstoppable AVL — an enduran
 ce coach and personal trainer who helps women build strength\, resilience\
 , and confidence from the inside out.\n\n**Tera will tell her story** — 
 how she got here\, what shaped her path\, and the moments that pushed her 
 to grow. Through her work\, she helps women step beyond their limits\, tru
 st themselves more deeply\, and tap into a strength they didn’t know the
 y had.\n\n✨Each month\, **She Owns It AVL** gathers women ready to grow\
 , connect\, and belong. We focus on life\, money\, mindset\, and wellness 
 — creating space for real conversations\, meaningful relationships\, and
  lasting connection and inspiration.\n\nWe can’t wait to see you there! 
 💫\nCome early to connect! 5:30\n\nWe’re so grateful for everyone who 
 signs up to join us! If your plans shift\, please update your RSVP—it he
 lps us plan the evening and make space for other women who’d love to att
 end.
